\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Gov Admits Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  To Help IDR \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 2003\par 07:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Burhanuddin Abdullah admitted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday to support the rupiah. He said it will continue to take action to reduce volatility if necessary. \par \par \uc2  But he declined to provide the amount of dollars the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold to help the local unit, which fell to a fresh three-month low of IDR8,650 against the dollar earlier Wednesday as foreign investors took profit on the rupiah and local bonds. \par \par \uc2  "We will stay in the market from time to time," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Burhanuddin's statement contradicted early Wednesday remarks by his senior deputy Anwar Nasution, who said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't sell the dollar in the market. \par \par \uc2  Burhanuddin said he expects the rupiah's weakness is "temporary," and a factor that isn't expected to obstruct the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy for easing rates. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has cut its benchmark one-month interest rate from around 13% late last year to 9.21% currently amid easing inflation and the rupiah's appreciation. \par \par \uc2  The rate cuts are expected to cut the bailout costs of local banks and spur economic growth. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; djn.jakarta@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Simon Harvey \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030723dz7n0009n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
