\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Up On Fresh Foreign Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 2003\par 11:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended slightly higher against the dollar Friday as foreign investors continued to buy the local unit to invest in the country's capital markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar finished at 8,545 rupiah, slightly down from Thursday's close at IDR8,555. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's fall Friday was a bit of a surprise for most dealers, who had expected follow-through profit-taking on the rupiah ahead of the weekend following its recent strong rally. \par \par \uc2  "This signifies the market is still very bullish on the rupiah," said a dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  He pointed out that the sale of Bank Danamon 51% stake to Singapore's Temasek and Deustche Bank has helped boost market confidence that the government is serious in implementing economic reform programs. \par \par \uc2  The government's efforts to revamp the economy have seen some results: high inflation is easing, and that gives the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  room to cut interest rates further. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday cut the overnight money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by 25 basis points to 10.75%. It was the fourth rate cut so far this year. \par \par \uc2  Lower interest rates are expected to spur economic growth, and also to relieve the bad debt problem in the country, which in the long turn will encourage banks to start lending afresh to companies. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to trade lower toward IDR8,490 Monday. Resistance for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected at IDR8,600. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Ryan Woo \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030509dz59000l7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
