\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia Gov Not Worried Over Rupiah's Sharp Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 April 2003\par 10:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank Indonesia isn't worried over the rupiah's recent sharp rise against the dollar and will leave it up to the market to determine an appropriate level for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank's governor Sjahril Sabirin said Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor added that the rupiah's recent strength is due to improving market sentiment toward Indonesian investments. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah rose to new 10-month high of 8,675 to the dollar Monday. \par \par \uc2  Worries over the possibility of a violent backlash over the U.S.-led war in Iraq sent the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower to 9,095 earlier this month. \par \par \uc2  But anti-war protests went off peacefully, which encouraged foreign investors to buy Indonesian portfolios that are offering favorable returns. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts have expressed concern that the rupiah's sharp rise may hurt Indonesian exports, which are already facing weakening demand from the country's main export destinations, such as the U.S. and Japan. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers have said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the rupiah's rise as it is trading outside the IDR8,800-IDR9,200 range that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had forecast for this year. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will leave the rupiah's exchange rate to market forces, as long as it isn't "too volatile." \par \par \uc2  Looking ahead, Sjahril said that he expected market sentiment toward the rupiah to remain positive, but didn't elaborate. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; djn.jakarta@dowjones.com. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030421dz4l000er\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
