\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Up On Uncertainty Over Iraq \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 10:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah extended its rally Friday as market participants trimmed their dollar-long positions amid uncertainties over the U.S.-led war in Iraq. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 8,965 rupiah, down from its close Thursday at IDR9,030. \par \par \uc2  "Market players are still holding long dollar positions but they wanted to reduce the amount as it's quite expensive holding dollar long positions amid high rupiah interest rates," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  The local market was concerned the U.S. attack would spark protests in Indonesia, the world's largest Muslim country, which could further deter foreign investment and tourism. \par \par \uc2  However, so far the protests have remained peaceful, which is a good signal for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In a verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin said Friday that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy to help the rupiah if necessary. \par \par \uc2  Although dealers said they didn't detect actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the bank in the local foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to trade between IDR8,900 and IDR9,100 Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277\par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Edited by Barry Deely\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030321dz3l000me\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
