\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk Gov: To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Protect Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 195 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 07:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Friday it stands ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the rupiah during the U.S.-led strike on Iraq. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves of $32 billion mean the country has adequate funds to stage a defense of the rupiah if necessary, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Sjahril Sabirin, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "We will continue to rely on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah," Sjahril said. He gave no details on whether the bank has already been active this week. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is trading at 9,030 rupiah midday Friday, flat on Thursday's close. But the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has moved higher in recent days on fears of anti-U.S. protests in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Demonstrators are expected to amass outside the U.S. embassy in Jakarta later Friday after weekly communal prayers. Indonesia is the world's most populous Muslim nation, and a large number of its people are against the war in Iraq. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones newswires; 6221 3983 1277; djn.jakarta@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Barry Deely \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030321dz3l000d8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\