\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Ends Flat;Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Suspected \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 10:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended flat against the U.S. dollar Thursday allegedly on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar rose to an intraday high of 8,925 to the rupiah on short covering before closing at IDR8,905, allegedly due to dollar selling by Bank Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has admitted to selling dollars in the past to prevent sharp falls in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but doesn't confirm specific \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the rupiah was also supported by trickling capital inflows linked to government asset sales. Some Indonesian businessmen are believed to be bringing back to Indonesia the money they parked overseas following the 1997-98 Asian financial crisis to buy assets at steep discounts. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect any U.S.-led military strike on Iraq to be followed by a knee-jerk reaction selling of the rupiah. U.S. military \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Middle East country could spark widespread anti-West protests in Indonesia, the world's most populous Muslim country. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to trade between IDR8,890 and IDR8,920 Friday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277;\par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Edited by Bernice Tang\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030313dz3d000nd\par }\page {\par\