\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Slightly Lower As Local Cos Buy Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2003\par 10:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended slightly lower Wednesday as local companies bought dollars to meet month-end offshore obligations, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar finished at 8,890 rupiah, up from its close Tuesday at IDR8,880. The dollar traded between IDR8,875 and IDR8,898 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said market participants have started to slowly cover their short-dollar positions, ahead of any U.S. attack on Iraq, which they said could happen as soon as March. \par \par \uc2  U.S. President George W. Bush and Defense Secretary Donald Rumsfeld both sounded hawkish about military options Tuesday. Rumsfeld said troops are ready to launch an attack on Iraq if necessary, while Bush said Iraq can avoid war only with "full disarmament" and reiterated his view that the U.S. can launch a strike on Iraq with or without a new U.N. resolution. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which occasionally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the rupiah comes under selling pressure, wasn't in the market Wednesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was expected to sell the dollar should the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit minor resistance at IDR8,900. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar may continue to rise, albeit slowly, as fears of a war in Iraq mount. \par \par \uc2  An attack on Iraq is expected to trigger anti-Western protests in Indonesia, which could further deter foreign investment. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to trade between IDR8,880 and IDR8,910 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Ryan Woo \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030226dz2q000or\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
