\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Flat; Market Ignores Donors' Pledge \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2003\par 10:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended flat against the dollar Wednesday, amid talk Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the local unit. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed unchanged at 8,885 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia was suspected again of selling dollars Wednesday, dealers said. Earlier, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit as high as IDR8,890 on bids from local companies looking to hedge future dollar obligations. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market whenever it thinks it's necessary to help shore up the rupiah's value, but it doesn't comment on any particular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  move. \par \par \uc2  The market ignored reports that international donors agreed to pledge $2.7 billion in aid to Indonesia this year to help the country get out of the current economic malaise. Still, the pledge was positive news for the rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is expected to trade between IDR8,870 and IDR8,890 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Meantime, rupiah stability encouraged Bank Indonesia to cut the benchmark weighted average rate on its one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia, or SBI, notes to 12.77% in a weekly auction from 12.84% last week. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to cut domestic interest rates to help reduce the hefty costs of bailing out a banking system that has been crippled by the 1997-98 Asian financial crisis. Lower rates are also expected to help spur economic growth. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030122dz1m000k5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
