\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's c.bank says Bali probe spurs rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2 489 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2002\par 06:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Nov 19 (Reuters) - Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the strengthening of the rupiah against the dollar on Tuesday to a more than two-month high was primarily due to police progress in the Bali bombing investigation. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - which sank to a five-and-a-half month low of 9,350 per dollar after the October 12 blasts on Indonesia's premier tourist island - was quoted at 8,985/8,995 per dollar around midday on Tuesday, its highest level since September 13. \par \par \uc2  "Progress in the Bali case, that's the main thing to do with the rupiah's strengthening," \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Miranda Goeltom told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  But one head of treasury at a foreign bank in Jakarta doubted the Bali probe was having much impact and said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the market, as recently as last week, to hold the unit around the 9,000 level. \par \par \uc2  "Most players are sitting here being a bit cynical about the bali bombing investigation," said the foreign bank source, who declined to be identified. \par \par \uc2  "Bank Indonesia has been in the market in the last couple of weeks and quite heavily - around $20-$30 million - not every day, just now and then," he added. \par \par \uc2  The government has proposed revising down the average rupiah rate for the 2003 budget to 9,000/dlr from a previous forecast of 8,700/dlr in the wake of the blasts, which killed nearly 200 mainly foreign tourists. \par \par \uc2  Despite the recent falls and the rupiah's failure to recover to anywhere near pre crisis levels, it is still the region's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , up more than 15 percent on the year. \par \par \uc2  Indonesian police investigating the Bali bombings have made significant progress in the past two weeks, beginning with the arrest of key suspect Amrozi, who confessed to his involvement, and the naming of six others as official suspects. \par \par \uc2  Goeltom said the rupiah was also benefitting from the overall strengthening of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the U.S. dollar and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tight monetary policy. She declined to say whether the bank was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The foreign bank source said he felt there was some potential upside in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , maybe to 8,850/dlr, but said any gains would likely be fragile, especially in light of continued security threats. \par \par \uc2  "There are more threats out there and still very high risk and for that very reason, I would be cautious of the rupiah and I think at these levels and below, multinationals especially will start picking up dollars again just to hedge themselves," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Australian and U.S. embassies in Jakarta on Friday issued notices saying they had received "credible information" about the possible targeting of international schools associated or identified with Western interests. \par \par \uc2  That warning prompted several major international schools in the capital to close. They remained shut on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021119dybj005ek\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
