\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Down As Cos Buy Dlrs To Pay Debts \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2002\par 11:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended slightly lower against the dollar in relatively active trading Thursday, as local companies demanded more dollars to pay offshore debts maturing at the end of the month, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 9,015 rupiah, slightly up from its close at IDR9,005 Wednesday. The dollar traded between IDR9,000 and IDR9,020 intraday. \par \par \uc2  Local companies are saddled with about $60 billion in offshore debts. Such demand for dollars often exerts pressure on the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia, however, did attempt to support the rupiah by actively selling dollars Thursday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  occasionally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the local unit. Bank Indonesia officials have stated that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would act in the market to prop up the rupiah, but usually decline to confirm any particular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian government has put IDR9,000 as the target average exchange rate for the dollar for this year - a level that analysts say would prove elusive. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect corporate dollar demand to continue to be healthy as the end of the month draws near, which will likely keep the dollar well-supported above IDR9,000 until the end of the month. \par \par \uc2  They expect the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade between IDR9,000 and IDR9,020 Friday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020926dy9q000me\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
