\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Ends Up; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Suspected \b0\par\par\uc2 217 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2002\par 11:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended slightly higher Tuesday thanks to suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to calm the jittery local foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ended at 9,050 rupiah, down slightly from its close Monday at IDR9,060 after rising to an intraday high of IDR9,070 earlier Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they suspected Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was dogged by an explosion Monday in Jakarta. The explosion, which occurred near a property owned by the U.S. embassy, unsettled the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The blast made us feel uncomfortable maintaining dollar-short positions," said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia along with state-owned banks were suspected of selling the dollar Tuesday to support the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Despite this, dealers said that the market is still slightly bullish on the dollar. \par \par \uc2  They expect the dollar to trade between IDR9,035 and IDR9,070 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the rupiah. However, the bank doesn't comment on specific actions. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020924dy9o000lc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
