\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia c.bank says closely watching rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2002\par 10:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Sept 16 (Reuters) - Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it is closely watching the rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which fell to one-month lows on Monday amid weak regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but traders said so far Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had stopped short of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was quoted at 9,050/9,060 against the dollar by 0815 GMT and despite its recent falls the local unit is still the best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region this year, gaining some 15 percent. \par \par \uc2  "It's not just the rupiah, other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are also weaker because of the uncertainty in the Middle east and outlook on the global economy. We will be closely watching the rupiah, any options are open," deputy governor Miranda Goeltom told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have said the rupiah's firmness in recent weeks - it hit 8,750 in early August and last week bounced off 8,800 - masked its vulnerability to a likely U.S.-led attack on Iraq. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah has been propped up by expectations of foreign investment inflows into the Indonesian Bank Restructuring Agency's bank privatisation programme. \par \par \uc2  Commented Sameer Goel, a strategist with Bank of America: "The risk-reward profile is against the rupiah at the moment because the market is not pricing in the prospect of a U.S. invasion on Iraq." \par \par \uc2  But Goel said Indonesia, being an oil exporter, would benefit from any spike in global oil prices spurred by an invasion of Iraq, although political sentiment might be adversely affected. \par \par \uc2  "The benefit from oil exports will be mitigated to some extent by the impact on the budget since oil in Indonesia is subsidised," he added. \par \par \uc2  Goel said slower growth in other parts of the world because of higher oil prices would also hurt the export-oriented country. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020916dy9g00go6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
