\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Up On Suspected  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 August 2002\par 11:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended slightly stronger Friday with Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 8,830 rupiah, down from its close Thursday at IDR8,845. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trading was quiet due to a lack of fresh incentives ahead of the weekend. \par \par \uc2  Thin trading volume provided the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with an opportunity to push the rupiah higher by selling small amounts of dollars. \par \par \uc2  The market didn't react to the announcement of the 2003 state budget and the narrower fiscal deficit of 1.3% of gross domestic product from 2.5% this year. \par \par \uc2  The International Monetary Fund, which is overseeing a $5-billion loan program for the economy, praised the budget as laying the foundation for future growth. By reducing subsidies on fuel and other utilities, the country will free up spending for public works and other projects to boost growth. \par \par \uc2  "It's a sound budget which should help reinforce macroeconomic stability," David Nellor, the fund's Indonesia representative, told Dow Jones Newswires. "It shows a lot of effort to bring about a more stable fiscal environment." \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's budget is deep in the red after the shock of the Asian financial crisis, which caused the country's economy to shrink 14% in 1998. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that underlying sentiment is still somewhat bullish on the rupiah, a fact that is expected to push the dollar below IDR8,800 next week. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020816dy8g000in\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
