\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Flat; Ctrl Bk Supports Local Unit \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 2002\par 11:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The rupiah ended flat Monday as suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  shielded the local unit from the waves of dollar buying across the region, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 9,080 rupiah, unchanged from its close Friday. It slid to its intraday low of IDR9,050 shortly after the market opened on suspected dollar selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  but rebounded steadily during the course of the day, hitting an intraday high of IDR9,105 as market participants bought the dollar in line with its rally against other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank Indonesia along with the Indonesian Bank Restructuring Agency were heard selling dollars on rallies. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said that it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah if necessary. Its officials, however, usually decline to comment on specific actions. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that market participants stopped buying the dollar above IDR9,100 because they thought the rise isn't sustainable due to concerns about the state of the U.S. economy. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to remain trapped between IDR9,050 and IDR9,100 Tuesday as the market seems to lack direction at current levels. \par \par \uc2  The market is so far ignoring the annual meeting of the country's highest legislative body as the sessions, which started Thursday, have remained peaceful so far. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020805dy85000j7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
