\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to help rupiah-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 391 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2002\par 10:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, July 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday morning to bolster the rupiah, which had sagged in the past two to three weeks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One bank treasurer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $50 million, while another said it was a "substantial" amount. \par \par \uc2  By 0734 GMT the rupiah was being quoted at 9,040/9,070 from a low of 9,170 earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  The reported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came before \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sjahril Sabirin said the rupiah would strengthen against the U.S. dollar on Friday afternoon. He did not give a reason but said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market if necessary. \par \par \uc2  "It's the most we've ever seen - they did upwards of $50 million," the first bank treasurer said. \par \par \uc2  "They're very keen to protect this 9,200 level so they might well come in with another $50 million plus this afternoon." \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated average daily turnover on the USD/rupiah market at around $200 million during the past month. They pinned the recent weakening of the rupiah partly on demand for dollars to repay foreign debts and importers covering payments. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its policy was not to comment on speculation of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's role is to prevent (excessive) volatility in the rupiah," a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  director, Made Sukada, said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, bank governor Sabirin said: \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is likely to strengthen again this afternoon. We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary. The important thing is market sentiment on the rupiah is improving," Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the bank would not raise its benchmark interest rates to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has weakened in the past two to three weeks from around 8,600 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Underscoring its concern over the rupiah's recent downtrend, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week called in all foreign and major local bank treasurers and asked them to exercise caution in trading activities, the first treasurer said. \par \par \uc2  "They're very worried about the 9,200 level. It's a technical level - if it breaks that, you open up the 9,500 area," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Personally, I think they're being a bit paranoid and are overreacting." \par \par \uc2  The 2002 state budget targets a rupiah rate of 9,000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020712dy7c00go9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
