\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Up As Local Stock Market Rebounds \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juli 2002\par 11:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The rupiah ended higher against the dollar Thursday, thanks to a rebound in local stocks and rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 8,860 rupiah, down from IDR8,965, Wednesday's close. The U.S. unit traded between IDR8,855 and IDR8,950 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah, in the last two days, had been under pressure due to a fall in Indonesian share prices, which lost as much as 5.1% in value after four consecutive sessions. After foreign investors sold their shares, they converted rupiah into dollars. \par \par \uc2  Indonesian shares, however, rebounded 2.13% Thursday, which helped put a shine back on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar purchases abated as stock prices rebound, whereas ... demand (for the dollar) from local companies faded," said a dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also heard to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in small amounts Thursday to accelerate the rupiah's rebound. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reported presence in the market since Tuesday is expected to drive the dollar down to IDR8,800 Friday. Resistance is expected at IDR8,900. \par \par \uc2  The annual session of the nation's highest legislative body is nearing, expected to start in August. Market players seem calm. The current stability is in stark contrast to the political infighting seen last year in the run-up to the session, which culminated with the sacking of Abdurrahman Wahid as president. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020704dy74000ia\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
