.wright@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020411dy4b000px\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
